{
    "background_story": "Cohen was a promising young athlete, known for his fearless attitude on the soccer field. But during a critical match, disaster struck when he landed awkwardly from a jump, fracturing his tibia in two places. The injury was severe, and Cohen's season was cut short. Devastated, he wondered if he'd ever regain his former strength and agility. But Cohen was determined to overcome the setback. He threw himself into rehabilitation, working tirelessly with his physical therapist to rebuild his strength and mobility. The road to recovery was long and arduous, but Cohen persevered, using the experience to develop a newfound appreciation for the game and a stronger mental toughness. Eventually, he made a triumphant return to the field, his fracture a distant memory, and his passion for soccer burning brighter than ever.",
